@startuml
' 食有灵 FOOD SOUL —— 活动图：结构化菜谱生成
' 依据：server/api.mjs handleRecipeLookup / handleRecipe、
'       server/recipe-lookup.mjs lookupDish、server/web-search.mjs webSearchMany（Promise.all 并行）、
'       server/recipe-schema.mjs validateRecipe（zod）
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor White
skinparam NoteBorderColor Black
skinparam NoteFontColor Black
skinparam DefaultFontColor Black
skinparam ArrowFontColor Black
skinparam ArrowFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam classAttributeFontColor Black
skinparam ActivityFontColor Black
skinparam StateFontColor Black

skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  ArrowColor Black
  DiamondBackgroundColor White
  DiamondBorderColor Black
}

title 结构化菜谱生成（图鉴优先 → 联网检索 → 模型知识）

start
:用户填写菜名、人数、难度、可用食材;
:前端 POST /api/recipe/lookup\n（不调用模型，游客可用，30 次/分钟限流）;
:lookupDish 按菜名与别名匹配图鉴;

if (图鉴命中？) then (是)
  :dataSource = library;
else (否)
  fork
    :SearXNG 检索;
  fork again
    :Bing RSS 检索;
  end fork
  :按 URL 去重合并，再按菜名做相关性过滤;
  if (存在相关结果？) then (是)
    :dataSource = ai-search\n附 sources 列表;
  else (否)
    :dataSource = ai-knowledge\n提示词禁止编造链接与人名;
  endif
endif

:前端 POST /api/recipe;
:resolveAIForRequest 校验配置;
if (配置可用？) then (否)
  :409 ai_disabled / ai_config_unavailable;
  stop
endif

:拼装 system 提示词\n（图鉴档案或检索资料注入）;
:chatStream 调用模型（120 秒超时）;
if (调用成功？) then (否)
  :SSE / JSON 返回可读错误;
  stop
endif

:validateRecipe 做 zod 结构校验\n（字段类型、枚举、条数区间）;
if (校验通过？) then (否)
  :返回错误，不渲染半成品;
  stop
else (是)
  :前端渲染菜谱卡片\n按 dataSource 显示来源徽标;
  stop
endif
@enduml
